lass=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Whichever is most comfortable for you.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le18ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Where do you need me next?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Can you cut up these yellow peppers that I've seeded?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How wide should the slices be?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Please make them thin, but not too thin. You should curl back your fingers so you don't cut them.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Good idea.", "id": 2, "time": "16000", "image": "engenn7le18ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Should I put on some music?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can do that! What's the station that you like?  It comes on in the early evening right?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's \u2018Melody Time'. Tune into KZ 2740. I also listen to \u2018What's Current', which is on in the afternoon. It starts again next weekend and plays from 1:00 to 3:00. The DJ who runs it has such a great voice.", "id": 3, "time": "28000", "image": "engenn7le18ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm ready for my next task.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're going to set the table.  <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Is Peter bringing flowers? They'll make the table look nice for the photos.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good idea.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'll call and tell him. He's coming around 5, right? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Uhm-hum.", "id": 4, "time": "46000", "image": "engenn7le18ob10re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Rice Cookout"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Helping Hand"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 18}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Requesting and Offering Help by E-mail"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>When you ask someone for help or advice, it is important to be very polite. </p><p>Here are some common sentences and expressions that are considered polite.</p>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Offering for Help</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking for Help</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Where do you need me next?</p><p>Should I put on some music?</p><p>I can do that!</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Can you cut up these yellow peppers that I've seeded?</p><p>Please make them thin, but not too thin.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Asking for Advice</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Offering Advice</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Should I use warm or cold water?</p><p>How wide should the slices be?</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>Whichever is most comfortable for you.</p><p>You should curl back your fingers so you don't cut them.</p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future with <span class=\"italic\">Will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">Going to</span>, the Present Simple"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use three different tenses to talk about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about  things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you talk about things that are scheduled, like programs, classes, buses or trains, you use the Present Simple tense."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Deciding Now</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I'll do anything.</p><p>They'll make the table look nice for the photos.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Intentions</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>I'm going to listen, learn and help!</p><p>You're going to rinse the rice gently, please.</p></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Schedules</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><p>It comes on in the early evening right?</p><p>It starts again next weekend and plays from 1:00 to 3:00. </p></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cut up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to divide into pieces"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Come over here and cut up these yellow peppers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you are preparing a meal with a friend."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to seed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take the seeds out of a vegetable or fruit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you seed the yellow peppers for me, please?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "whichever"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "your choice"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(pronoun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do whichever you think is easiest for you."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to curl back"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to roll into a tight space"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should curl back your fingers so you don't cut them."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tune into"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to set your radio or TV to catch a channel"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Tune into radio station KZ 2740 for great music all day long!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le18ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le18ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between two people who are making a meal together."}, {"type": "text", "content": "One person will ask for advice and the other person will give advice about cooking."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use <span class=\"italic\">who</span>, <span class=\"italic\">that</span> or <span class=\"italic\">which</span> to express a complex idea."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue with someone."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about making a meal."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for advice and offer help."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express complex ideas."}]}], "type": "sena"}